VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "This hall is the MASTER's. Turn\n"
    .string "back while you still can!$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Burnt out.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt1Post::
    .string "The lair is a maze of statues.\n"
    .string "The Hall of Stones is north.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "You came through the CAVE? Then\n"
    .string "you are the one the boss expects.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "He was right about you…$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt2Post::
    .string "Do not touch the stones. They\n"
    .string "bite.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "Fists first, questions later!$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Beaten by a kid!$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt3Post::
    .string "The red-capped boy went up the\n"
    .string "stairs on his own. We let him.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt4Intro::
    .string "Ruins, relics, ritual! You do not\n"
    .string "belong in this one!$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt4Defeat::
    .string "The ritual is broken…$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt4Post::
    .string "Ten stones, ten seats. The boss\n"
    .string "only needs two more.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt5Intro::
    .string "The treasure room is mine!$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt5Defeat::
    .string "My treasure!$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_Grunt5Post::
    .string "Take it. It is only a medicine\n"
    .string "chest. The real prize is upstairs.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_VesperIntro::
    .string "VESPER: Third time, child. Do you\n"
    .string "know where you are standing?\p"
    .string "The MASTER's HALL. The old\n"
    .string "heroes died on that threshold.\p"
    .string "I will not let you pass it.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_VesperDefeat::
    .string "…Again. Again you break the\n"
    .string "pattern.$"

VictoryRoadLair_1F_Text_VesperPost::
    .string "VESPER: The red-capped one is in\n"
    .string "the HALL of STONES, then beyond.\p"
    .string "Go. SELENE keeps the door.$"
